jobs.description:
Would you like to work in your own shift and be part of a close-knit team? Apply now as an All-round Warehouse Operator! As an all-round warehouse operator, you will be involved in the entire logistics process. One day you will be working in the inbound department, ensuring that all incoming goods are processed in the warehouse according to plan. The next day you will be working in the outbound department, picking or packing goods and ensuring that they are shipped to the right customer on time. No two days are the same, and this also offers you the opportunity to further specialise and grow! You will be working in a 2-shift system. The working hours are from 7:00 a.m. to 3:30 p.m. and from 3:30 p.m. to midnight.

As a Logistics Employee 2-Shift Work, you recognise yourself in the following job requirements:  - You want to work in a 2-shift system;
 - You can work accurately in a quiet and tidy working environment;
 - You are proficient in Dutch and/or English;
